## 常用代码模式

### 检查持仓并下单
```python
def handle_data(context, data):
    security = g.security
    position = context.portfolio.positions.get(security)
    current_amount = position.amount if position else 0

    if current_amount == 0:
        # 无持仓，考虑买入
        if context.portfolio.cash > 10000:
            order_value(security, context.portfolio.cash * 0.9)
    else:
        # 有持仓，考虑卖出
        if some_sell_condition:
            order_target(security, 0)
```

### 遍历持仓计算盈亏
```python
def after_trading_end(context, data):
    for security, pos in context.portfolio.positions.items():
        if pos.amount > 0:
            pnl = (pos.last_sale_price - pos.cost_basis) * pos.amount
            log.info(f"{security}: 盈亏={pnl:.2f}")
```
